 *  Benefit or PTS #: #9031 C-0 mandatory.
 *  Testing: testcase now passes; cfj also ran some SAT.
 *  Module(s): .../server/tnc/tnc.defs
 *
 * For rfork(), make the new child proc's task and thread ports move back
 * to the parent's node with MOVE_SEND, rather than COPY_SEND to prevent
 * these two ports from leaking as deadnames with every rfork() call.  This
 * brings rfork()'s handling of these two ports into line with plain fork()'s.
 *
 * Revision 1.13  1994/03/14  02:06:55  slk
 * Checkpoint Restart Code Drop
 *  Reviewer: Stefan Tritscher
